237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (The main purpose of the Phishing Email Detection & Awareness Assessment is to analyze phishing email samples and highlight the differences that can help distinguish phishing emails from legitimate ones. This assessment aims to raise awareness about phishing, explain what phishing attempts are, and how to protect oneself from them. Since phishing relies mostly on human error, the awareness level has a significant influence on the possibility of a successful attack. Another objective of the assessment is to go through the elements of each email and highlight the similarities and differences.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
238 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 167 0 R
/E (Among other goals, the assessment also aims to explain the significance of classification and risk levels for emails. For each email, an in-depth analysis is made to spot the features that can help distinguish phishing from legitimate emails. Moreover, each email is classified into Phishing, Suspicious, and Safe categories. Classification allows an adequate perception of the risk level of each email. In addition, the impact of the phishing emails on the business and the possible consequences of an attack are discussed. Furthermore, the analysis provides the recommendations for protection from phishing.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
